## Domain Layer Rules

`Domain/` contains pure business logic — no SwiftUI imports, no UIKit.

### SliceModels.swift
- All model types: `Codable`, `Equatable`, `Sendable`
- `SliceStage` is the CPA phase enum; do not add stages without a spec and ADR

### SliceStateMachine.swift
- Pure static functions only — no state, no side effects
- `nextStage(after:success:showTransfer:)` is the single source of truth for transitions
- Validate transitions before acting in `VerticalSliceEngine`

### VerticalSliceEngine.swift
- `@MainActor final class` — all mutations here
- Emit telemetry events via `telemetryWriter` on every meaningful state change
- Call `speechService.speak()` for child-facing prompts
- New problem types must add a `skillTag` to `SliceProblem`

### ProblemGenerator.swift
- Must be deterministic when `deterministicMode = true` (for tests)
- All generated problems must satisfy: `decompositionA + decompositionB == target`
